{"parentUuid":null,"isSidechain":true,"promptId":"b9474645-0d56-40f0-a822-a5a662a1bfd0","agentId":"a0b6fa2949affdad1","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"这是 **P0 路线图项的源码核实任务**，按 `feedback_verify_solver_param_claims.md` 方法（R5 shared_tree 已 REFUTED，R2 UNSAT subsolver 已 PARTIALLY_REFUTED，模式数据：参数级 P0 救火率已 2/2）。\n\n**目标项**：路线图 P0 #23 \"`presolve_extract_integer_enforcement = True`\"，R11 a67cf942cd679915d 给的预期 \"+5-15% baseline，maybe 2-3×\"\n**项目背景**：CP-SAT 9.15，master 跑 max_lex(area, min_side)，约 100 处 OnlyEnforceIf（半 reify），8 worker\n\n**任务（≤700 字）：**\n\n1. 读 R11 transcript `D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\docs\\research\\agent_transcripts\\a67cf942cd679915d.output` 找原推荐细节（什么场景下该参数有效、为什么 +5-15%、引用来源）\n2. **OR-Tools v9.15 源码核实**：\n   - `presolve_extract_integer_enforcement` 在 `sat_parameters.proto` 的字段编号 + 默认值 + 完整注释\n   - 在哪个 presolve pass 用（grep `cp_model_presolve.cc` 该参数名 + 周围 50 行）\n   - 实际把什么形式重写成什么（举例 enforcement = b implies (linear ≥ k) → 是怎么\"extract integer enforcement\"的？是变成 `b * something + (1-b) * something_else`？）\n   - 对 max objective 模式是 sound 的吗？还是有什么副作用（LP relaxation 变松、incumbent 路径改变）\n3. **是否和别的参数互斥/冲突**：\n   - 与 `presolve_use_bva` / `cp_model_presolve` / `linearization_level` 是否有 known interaction\n   - 开启后 logging 能否看到 simplification count（用来 A/B 验证它真做事了）\n4. **关键判断**：R11 给的 \"+5-15%（maybe 2-3×）\" 是 SAT/MILP benchmark 引用 还是 CP-SAT 团队官方说法？我们 max_lex + 100 处 enforcement 这种场景适用吗？\n\n**关键 URL**：\n- proto: https://github.com/google/or-tools/blob/v9.15/ortools/sat/sat_parameters.proto\n- presolve: https://github.com/google/or-tools/blob/v9.15/ortools/sat/cp_model_presolve.cc\n- GitHub issue 搜 https://github.com/google/or-tools/issues?q=presolve_extract_integer_enforcement\n\n输出末尾：'P0 #23 verdict = REFUTED / PARTIALLY_REFUTED / VERIFIED' + 是否保留 P0 + 推荐配置（如果 VERIFIED 给 A/B 5 wave 实验设计：开 vs 关 各跑 wave 看哪个 metric 显著差）"},"uuid":"0b08055c-f0bf-48ca-a3d8-948f410b7a7d","timestamp":"2026-05-07T23:01:23.661Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claud