{"parentUuid":"bbeade1f-e5b8-45c0-b39f-c9e3ba9f2683","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"b9474645-0d56-40f0-a822-a5a662a1bfd0","agentId":"a0b6fa2949affdad1","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01C15xPfSmfXMVmHt9E7P5Mf","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t{\"parentUuid\":null,\"isSidechain\":true,\"promptId\":\"11f7002f-1250-416f-bd07-34f6030c1de7\",\"agentId\":\"a67cf942cd679915d\",\"type\":\"user\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"调研 Sequential / Commander / Totalizer / Tournament / Sorting Network 等 cardinality SAT encoding 在 CP-SAT 风格求解器的实证对比，特别是对 OnlyEnforceIf / channeling constraint 的影响。\\n\\n**背景：** Round 7 a7a4c0f20baf602f5 调研 OnlyEnforceIf 100 处审计。但那一轮聚焦\\\"哪些可以改写\\\"，没深入到\\\"改写后用什么 cardinality encoding\\\"。不同 encoding 的 propagation 强度差几个量级。\\n\\n**调研重点（≤800 字）：**\\n1. Sequential / Commander / Bimander / Pairwise / Sorting Network / Totalizer 各自传播性\\n2. Cardinality propagator vs 显式 encoding，CP-SAT 内部走哪条\\n3. OR-Tools 是否暴露选择 encoding 的参数\\n4. 现代趋势：lazy decomposition / Generalized Totalizer\\n5. 对我们 OnlyEnforceIf 100 处的具体影响\\n6. 是否有\\\"换 encoding 直接降 search tree\\\"的实证\\n\\n输出末尾：\\\"Top 3 改进方向 + 工程成本\\\"\"},\"uuid\":\"1258ffae-0f09-41e9-9c64-77b9c83a754c\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-05-07T22:24:58.623Z\",\"userType\":\"external\",\"entrypoint\":\"cli\",\"cwd\":\"D:\\\\claude pj\\\\zmd\\\\.upstream_clones\",\"sessionId\":\"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9\",\"version\":\"2.1.128\",\"gitBranch\":\"master\",\"slug\":\"squishy-zooming-sphinx\"}\n2\t{\"parentUuid\":\"1258ffae-0f09-41e9-9c64-77b9c83a754c\",\"isSidechain\":true,\"agentId\":\"a67cf942cd679915d\",\"attachment\":{\"type\":\"deferred_tools_delta\",\"addedNames\":[\"EnterWorktree\",\"ExitWorktree\",\"Monitor\",\"NotebookEdit\",\"TaskStop\",\"WebFetch\",\"WebSearch\"],\"addedLines\":[\"EnterWorktree\",\"ExitWorktree\",\"Monitor\",\"NotebookEdit\",\"TaskStop\",\"WebFetch\",\"WebSearch\"],\"removedNames\":[],\"readdedNames\":[]},\"type\":\"attachment\",\"uuid\":\"312b0